======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 108 - Metrics: Counters, Gauges, & Histograms
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Logging every request to text file and parsing with regex.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Prometheus metric types: Counters (total requests), Gauges (active connections), Histograms (latency).

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
